{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24494","headline":"对镜偶吟赠张道士抱元 · 白居易","name":"对镜偶吟赠张道士抱元","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲来对镜自思量，年貌衰残分所当。\n白发万茎何所怪，丹砂一粒不曾尝。\n眼昏久被书料理，肺渴多因酒损伤。\n今日逢师虽已晚，枕中治老有何方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}